{
  "id": "personal-data-in-output-is-redacted",
  "level": "guardrails",
  "spec": "31.5",
  "description": "Personal data in an agent's output is replaced before anything else sees it. The redacted value is what the contract checks, what goes on in the token's data and what is journalled; the record gives positions and categories, and the original text appears in no event.",
  "workflow": {
    "id": "8405ffb8-39c5-51dc-9ad9-7dd7356d3792",
